Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add base layout, role-aware navigation and accessibility
 baseline (S-03)

- templates/base.html: responsive page shell with skip link, landmarks and
  labelled main navigation.
- config/context_processors.py: menu declared once per role; entries whose
  URL does not exist yet are skipped so later stories appear automatically.
- templates/components/form.html: reusable form with error summary and
  labelled fields.
- static/css/app.css: visible focus, 44px targets, AA contrast (ratios
  checked), narrow-screen layout.
- config/settings/test.py and pytest.ini: tests run with no env variables.
- Remove tests/test_smoke.py as its own docstring instructs.

